# A milico (agent of the territorial police of La Pampa) in 1919, the
# criollo: about 30 (age 0.54), a son of the country with some Asian and
# African in the macros, lean and hard, broad cheekbones and a strong jaw,
# black hair and a black moustache, about 1.70 m. The agent's plain
# uniform, the same for the three milicos (no comisario insignia: a single
# column of brass buttons, no shoulder strap): a dark navy guerrera with a
# stiff high collar and a short skirt, a dark bombacha tucked into black
# knee boots, a brown leather belt with a plain buckle, and a navy kepi
# with a black band, visor and chin strap. The garments are cut from the
# body by the converter.
#
# Lines MakeHuman does not know (it warns and skips them) are read by
# tools/mh2gltf.py: piece (see ../../README.md). Credits in
# ../../CREDITS.md.
